WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:16.564
It was late at night in Metro City Park.

2
00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.905
In the lake the frogs croaked softly.

3
00:00:22.006 --> 00:00:24.226
Suddenly a bright object fell from the sky.

4
00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:27.687
It splashed into the lake.

5
00:00:28.927 --> 00:00:30.728
The water bubbled up and turned purple.

6
00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.293
Ribbit! Ribbit!

7
00:00:36.816 --> 00:00:39.898
The next day Roxy and her friends were in the woods in Metro City Park.

8
00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.580
"Look at me!"

9
00:00:42.821 --> 00:00:44.842
called Terrell from the top of a giant boulder.

10
00:00:44.862 --> 00:00:47.725
"I'm taller than everyone!"

11
00:00:47.745 --> 00:00:50.287
"I'm coming up there!"

12
00:00:50.647 --> 00:00:51.228
said Mara.

13
00:00:51.248 --> 00:00:53.189
"Me too!"

14
00:00:53.489 --> 00:00:54.150
said Roxy.

15
00:00:56.152 --> 00:00:57.713
The two girls started climbing up.

16
00:00:57.733 --> 00:01:01.156
"Not me," said Jack.

17
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:03.417
"I don't like high places."

18
00:01:03.437 --> 00:01:06.278
"You're scared of high places?"

19
00:01:06.738 --> 00:01:07.338
asked Mara.

20
00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:10.020
"I'm not scared," said Jack.

21
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.541
"I just don't like being high up."

22
00:01:14.161 --> 00:01:14.962
Terrell shrugged.

23
00:01:14.982 --> 00:01:17.323
"That's okay," he said.

24
00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.404
"I don't like the dark."

25
00:01:19.424 --> 00:01:22.745
"I'm scared of monsters," said Mara.

26
00:01:22.765 --> 00:01:25.626
"Especially ones with fangs!"

27
00:01:25.726 --> 00:01:29.428
"That's not a problem," said Terrell.

28
00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.021
"Rocket Girl can protect us from monsters."

29
00:01:34.082 --> 00:01:35.022
He looked at Roxy.

30
00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:37.423
"What are you afraid of, Roxy?"

31
00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:39.724
Just then Mara called out.

32
00:01:39.744 --> 00:01:41.125
"Oh look!

33
00:01:41.505 --> 00:01:43.245
I see a frog under those leaves!"

34
00:01:44.906 --> 00:01:47.127
Mara jumped down and picked up the small frog.

35
00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:51.129
Terrell and Jack walked over.

36
00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.850
"Eww! Eww!"

37
00:01:55.331 --> 00:01:55.991
said Roxy.

38
00:01:56.011 --> 00:01:57.491
"What's wrong?"

39
00:01:57.892 --> 00:01:58.472
asked Mara.

40
00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:02.301
"Keep that frog away from me," said Roxy.

41
00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:06.623
"Gross!" "So you're scared of frogs?"

42
00:02:07.143 --> 00:02:07.743
said Jack.

43
00:02:07.763 --> 00:02:11.785
"I'm not scared," said Roxy uneasily.

44
00:02:11.805 --> 00:02:14.626
"I just think they're gross."

45
00:02:14.646 --> 00:02:18.988
"Maybe Rocket Girl can help you," said Terrell.

46
00:02:19.008 --> 00:02:20.608
"Help me?"

47
00:02:21.029 --> 00:02:21.669
asked Roxy.

48
00:02:21.689 --> 00:02:24.130
"Yeah," said Terrell.

49
00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:27.251
"Help you not to be scared of frogs."

50
00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:29.252
Roxy frowned.

51
00:02:30.044 --> 00:02:32.746
"I just said I'm not—" Ribbit!

52
00:02:33.306 --> 00:02:35.847
Ribbit! "What was that?"

53
00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:37.508
asked Jack, looking around.

54
00:02:37.528 --> 00:02:41.331
"It sounded like a frog," said Terrell.

55
00:02:41.351 --> 00:02:43.852
"But it was really loud."

56
00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:46.293
Nearby a tree fell over.

57
00:02:46.313 --> 00:02:51.616
Crack! Another tree crashed down.

58
00:02:52.657 --> 00:02:57.400
Smash! The friends held their breath as a huge creature moved closer.

59
00:03:03.304 --> 00:03:05.165
"It It's a frog!"

60
00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:05.825
cried Terrell.

61
00:03:05.845 --> 00:03:06.625
"It's a huge frog!"

62
00:03:07.085 --> 00:03:07.685
said Mara.

63
00:03:07.705 --> 00:03:10.266
"It's bigger than a car!"

64
00:03:10.586 --> 00:03:11.166
said Jack.

65
00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:16.168
Croak! The giant frog hopped into the air and was gone.

66
00:03:18.408 --> 00:03:19.729
Roxy's face turned pale.

67
00:03:20.729 --> 00:03:22.070
A moment later her watch beeped.

68
00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.671
Roxy moved away from her friends.

69
00:03:28.091 --> 00:03:30.292
She pressed a button and Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

70
00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.002
"Let me guess, Mayor," whispered
